    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/c0c173d87b2f741ef0395bd938201b24.avif?t=1750193928\" width=440 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sloppy Fields is a cozy idle farming game\u00a0where you manage a farm in a field full of horny creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure to keep a good balance between days in the fields, and days in the sheets, and try to pay your huge debt to the IRS.</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/b76206a70b2af854788bde9e052b476d.avif?t=1750193928\" width=440 height=188 /></span><br><strong>  </strong><br> <br>After their father's disappearance, Nico and Leo inherit their father's old farm, where a cast of colorful monster girls and other kinds of companions reside.  <br>The two brothers will soon realize that, to become great farmers, they will have to sacrifice their backs (<i>and their hip bones) </i><br> <br><i>  </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/cf3068233612fdc27fcfb041393d1907.poster.avif?t=1750193928\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/cf3068233612fdc27fcfb041393d1907.webm?t=1750193928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/cf3068233612fdc27fcfb041393d1907.mp4?t=1750193928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409760/extras/5ed0faa9fd102b1dbb35632c547b07dc.avif?t=1750193928\" width=440 height=188 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cozy and laid-back farm-management  experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hand-painted pixel art scenarios and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 races of animals to breed and sell, coming with 5 farming biomes as well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming skills to upgrade and automate your farm's efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various high quality pixel art animations. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
